  "description": "Static game-data tables for SetNet: load item/skill/npc/spawn definitions from JSON into fast id-keyed DataTable<TId,TRow> lookups, hot-reloadable at runtime. Rows are your own POCOs, so every table can carry any custom columns. No wire protocol; usable server- and client-side. Depends only on System.Text.Json.",
